      "id": "COL-008",
      "impact": "The key includes target_group, condition, instance, and repetition but not target_host/coordinator. Intended manifests keep the host stable, yet an accidental rerun on another coordinator in the same group could be merged.",
      "recommendation": "Add target_host or a topology/coordinator identity to the logical key, or validate it as an immutable context field before resolution.",
